    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Features",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>✓ Compatible with the Smile Therapy 5-in-1 Oscillating Electric Toothbrush<br\/><br\/>✓ Designed for 5 brushing modes, no need to switch heads<br\/><br\/>✓ Angled bristles reach deep into tight spaces and hard-to-reach areas<br\/><br\/>✓ Gentle on gums, tough on plaque and stains<br\/><br\/>✓ Easy to rinse, quick to replace, always ready to refresh your routine<br\/><br\/>✓ Keeps your brushing experience effective, hygienic, and consistently clean<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "dc156c5a-46c9-43e5-acbd-475340353fc0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "When should I replace the brush-head?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>For best results, we recommend changing your brush head every <strong>2 months<\/strong>. A fresh head helps maintain powerful cleaning performance, protects gum health, and keeps your oral hygiene routine feeling like new.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Care Tips",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p>✔ Rinse your brush head thoroughly after every use<br\/>✔ Store upright in a dry place<br\/>✔ Change heads regularly for maximum plaque removal<br\/>✘ Do not share heads between users<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>4x Oscillating Electric Brush Heads<\/li><\/ul><p><em>Toothbrush handle sold separately<\/em><\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "2eef6090-250f-48ad-a4ec-4aacca83c975": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cautions",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>✘ Not recommend to use by Children under the age of 9.<\/p><p>✔ Please make sure to wash your mouth with warm water after use.<\/p><p>✔ Includes 1 year manufacturer warranty.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_jVCAfr": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I replace the brush head?",
            "icon": "return",
            "row_content": "",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_iBYy4T": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can the Air Advanced Electric Toothbrush be used on composite bonding, veneers or fillings?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the Air Advanced Electric Toothbrush is suitable for use on composite bonding, veneers, and fillings. It has been designed to be gentle yet effective, ensuring thorough cleaning without causing damage to these dental materials. The advanced bristle technology and multiple brushing modes help maintain oral hygiene and remove plaque, providing a comprehensive clean even with these dental restorations.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
